<title>UK: Sullom Voe Brent rise in week ending Dec 11.</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe Brent rise in week ending Dec 11.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loadings of Brent crude from Britain's Sullom Voe terminal totalled 741,647 tonnes in the week to December 11, up from the previous week's 567,855 tonnes, the Shetlands Islands Council Marine Operations said.</p>
<p>All but two of the shipments were to European destinations.</p>
<p>Two cargoes sailed to the U.S.</p>
